    politicalRiskPremiumForex: [["political event timeline is marked", "The source is visible."], ["affected currency and premium proxy are named", "Risk premium must be traceable."], ["price acceptance or unwind is shown", "The premium can fade."], ["rumor-only trap is labeled", "Unconfirmed events are fragile."], ["sessions, spread, and pip distance are recorded", "Forex context is complete."]],
